abstract: >-
  flexible_schema provides a simple vehicle to specify and
  validate schemas for PyArrow tables and JSON objects that
  permit extension tables with additional columns, optional
  columns that may be missing wholesale (but that must
  conform to the specified type if present), column-order
  agnostic validation, and modes type-coercion where
  permissible.
